.TH MYSTRCAT 1 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B char *mystrcat(char *destination, const char *source);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcat
function appends the source string to the end of the destination string.
The destination string must have enough space to contain both strings.
